      {
       "name": "title",
       "type": "string",
       "value": "FIELD BRIEF"
      },
      {
       "name": "text",
       "type": "string",
       "value": "Kaela \u2014 talk to Gaia (green) by the crash, then Asha at her camp: the woods need friends. Both glowing fragments open the road; the trails ring round, so every clearing has two ways in. The road to the City leaves the south-east meadow. Do not let the UEC wipe her."
      }
     ]
    },
