      },
      {
       "name": "title",
       "type": "string",
       "value": "STANDING STONES"
      },
      {
       "name": "text",
       "type": "string",
       "value": "Every trail meets here. NE: the pond. E: the grove. S: Asha's camp. W: the mossy hollow and round to the crash. Fragments glow out there (a dark grotto by the pond, thorns past the grove); a fallen boulder blocks the City road beyond the south-east meadow."
      }
     ]
    },
